Clean-room provenance: Potrace algorithm
-----------------------------------------
Spryteo's polygon simplification and Bezier-fitting stage
(`crates/spryteo-fit`) implements the algorithm described in
Peter Selinger's paper "Potrace: a polygon-based tracing algorithm"
(https://potrace.sourceforge.net/potrace.pdf). The algorithm as
described in that paper is not itself copyrightable; only its
expression in code is.

No source code, object code, or documentation from the Potrace
project (which is licensed GPL-2.0) was read, copied, ported, or
otherwise consulted at any point during the implementation of this
crate. The implementation was written solely from the published paper
above and from first-principles computational geometry.

